[11] [i7737]Mekanism Fusion Reactor: Activation
[12] [i7738]To activate the Fusion Reactor, we will need a few things.
[13] [i7739]You will need to put a Hohlraum filled with D-T fuel in the Controller.
[14] [i7740]You will need to shoot 400MRF using Lasers into the Laser Matrix.
