[23] [i7749]The Fusion Reactor is built using this pattern for each face.
[24] [i7750]You will need a port for exporting power.
[25] [i7751]The Laser Matrix is used to kickstart the reactor.
[26] [i7752]The Fusion Reactor Controller must be placed in the middle of the top face.
[27] [i7753]You will need two ports for inputting Deuterium
[28] [i7754]and Tritium.
[29] [i7755]Using the Harvester Pylon
[30] [i7756]The Harvester Pylon
[31] [i7757]needs storage above it
[32] [i7758]to place harvested items into
[33] [i7759]The Harvester Pylon
[34] [i7760]can be set to harvest
[35] [i7761]in an area of:
[36] [i7762]3x3
[37] [i7763]5x5
[38] [i7764]7x7
[39] [i7765]9x9
[40] [i7766]is placed in the water
[41] [i7767]block for the farm
[42] [i7768]The Harvester Pylon
[43] [i7769]needs a hoe in it's
[44] [i7770]inventory to operate
[45] [i7771]it's durability will be
[46] [i7772]used during harvesting
[47] [i7773]The Harvester Pylon
[48] [i7774]Mekanism: Induction Matrix
[49] [i7775]The Induction Matrix is used to store tons of Power.
[50] [i7776]The Edges Must Be Casings
[51] [i7777]The Faces Can Be Either Casings Or Structural Glass.
[52] [i7778]Ports Are Used To Transfer Power.
[53] [i7779]Ports Can Be Changed Using A Configurator.
[54] [i7780]Induction Cells Are Used To Increase Power Storage.
[55] [i7781]Induction Providers Are Used To Increase Power Transfer Rate.
[56] [i7782]The Matrix Must Have One Cell and One Provider.
[57] [i7783]Mekanism Supercritical Phase Shifter (SPS)
[58] [i7784]The SPS converts Polonium into Antimatter Gas using a large amount of power
[59] [i7785]Ports Can Be Changed Using A Configurator
[60] [i7786]The SPS is built using this pattern for each face.
[61] [i7787]On one side, you will need a Port in the middle to input power.
[62] [i7788]On the inside, place a Supercharged Coil on the Port.
[63] [i7789]You can also use two Supercharged Coils for max power usage.
[64] [i7790]You will need one Port for inputting Polonium.
[65] [i7791]And another for exporting Antimatter Gas.
[66] [i7792]Getting Started with Corail Tombstone
[67] [i7793]Kill Undead Mobs
[68] [i7794]This has a rare chance to drop Grave's Dust
[69] [i7795]And a rarer chance to drop Essence of Undeath
[70] [i7796]Graves
[71] [i7797]Graves come in two marble colors
[72] [i7798]and six different styes
[73] [i7799]30 minutes after a grave is placed
[74] [i7800]or the previous soul is used
[75] [i7801]a new soul will spawn
[76] [i7802]Mekanism: Industrial Turbine
[77] [i7803]The Industrial Turbine uses Heated Coolant to create Power.
[78] [i7804]A max of 5 can be placed. They either must connect to each other, or be touching the Rotational Complex.
[79] [i7805]Saturating Condensers are used to convert Steam back into Water. These are not required, but must be placed on or above the Coil Layer.
[80] [i7806]The Top Face can be replaced with Turbine Vents, if needed.
[81] [i7807]The edges must be made of Turbine Casings.
[82] [i7808]The faces can be Turbine Casings, Structural Glass, Valves, or Vents.
[83] [i7809]Turbine Valves pump in Steam, or export Power.
[84] [i7810]Turbine Rotors must be placed in the middle. Each Rotor uses 2 Turbine Blades.
[85] [i7811]A Rotational Complex must be placed on top of the Turbine Rotor.
[86] [i7812]Pressure Dispersers must fill the layer around the Rotational Complex.
[87] [i7813]Starting on this layer, Turbine Vents can be used for the outer faces. These also export Water from the Turbine.

